+        Downsampler2x4Sse.h
+        Author: Laurent de Soras, 2015
+
+Downsamples vectors of 4 float by a factor 2 the input signal, using SSE
+instruction set.
+
+This object must be aligned on a 16-byte boundary!
+
+Template parameters:
+	- NC: number of coefficients, > 0
+
