+
+        HalfBand2F64Sse2.h
+        Author: Laurent de Soras, 2021
+
+Half-band filter, low-pass or high-pass, using SSE2 instruction set.
+Works on vectors of 2 double.
+
+This object must be aligned on a 16-byte boundary!
+
+Template parameters:
+	- NC: number of coefficients, > 0
+
+--- Legal stuff ---
