+
+        HalfBand4F64Avx.h
+        Author: Laurent de Soras, 2021
+
+Half-band filter, low-pass or high-pass, using AVX instruction set.
+Works on vectors of 4 double.
+
+This object must be aligned on a 32-byte boundary!
+
+Template parameters:
+	- NC: number of coefficients, > 0
+
