--- a/src/3rdparty/hiir/hiir/PhaseHalfPiSse.h	1969-12-31 19:00:00.000000000 -0500
+++ b/src/3rdparty/hiir/hiir/PhaseHalfPiSse.h	2023-01-25 01:28:17.000000000 -0500
@@ -0,0 +1,145 @@
+/*****************************************************************************
+
+        PhaseHalfPiSse.h
+        Author: Laurent de Soras, 2005
+
+From the input signal, generates two signals with a pi/2 phase shift, using
+SSE instruction set.
+
+This object must be aligned on a 16-byte boundary!
+
+The output is delayed from 2 sample, compared to the theoretical formula (or
+FPU implementation).
