+/*************************************************************************/
+/* test_par.cpp - test files for parallel ringbuffer writing             */
+/* Copyright (C) 2014-2019                                               */
+/* Johannes Lorenz (j.git@lorenz-ho.me, $$$=@)                           */
+/*                                                                       */
